oss of -0.249 at epoch 6 (Figure 3).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"calib_easy_000_s15","report_id":"calib_easy_000","text":"Baseline has a loss of 0.233 at epoch 14.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"calib_easy_000_s16","report_id":"calib_easy_000","text":"CNN has a loss of 1.344 at epoch 2.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"calib_easy_000_s17","report_id":"calib_easy_000","text":"The differences between the models are discussed in the next section.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"}]}